June Rutherford, your royal chili highness, is 95 years old. June has been in the business since she was a little girl, when her father carried her around in the fields in a pepper sack. There's even a chili pepper variety named after her, the Miss Juni. And she wasn't going to let a little wind stop her from talking up New Mexico, Chile. Our chili has a better taste than anywhere else and I'm not bragging. There's nobody, Texas, Arizona, California, and even Colorado can't beat us. They can't beat us. We have something that nobody's gone. There's no secret ingredient to New Mexico's chili peppers, unless you count tradition.
琼·卢瑟福，您的辣椒皇室殿下，今年已经95岁了。琼从小就开始从事辣椒行业，那时她的父亲把她装在胡椒麻袋里抱进田里。甚至还有一个以她的名字命名的辣椒品种，叫“小琼”。她可不会让一点微风阻挡她为新墨西哥州辣椒大加赞赏。“我们的辣椒比任何地方的都好吃，我可不是在吹牛。没有人——德克萨斯、亚利桑那、加利福尼亚，甚至科罗拉多——都赢不了我们。他们赢不了我们。我们拥有别人没有的东西。”新墨西哥州的辣椒没有什么秘密配料，除非你把传统也算作一种。

7
