everybody told me I had to talk to a guy named Glenn Duggins. They told me that Glenn was a great, cheery, friendly guy. But when I first called him about chili, and I asked, is this Glenn? He answered, what's left of him? Do you ever get nostalgic about the old chili days?
每个人都告诉我，我必须去和一个叫格伦·杜金斯的人聊聊。他们说格伦是个开朗、热情、友好的人。但当我第一次因为辣椒的事打电话给他，问“请问是格伦吗？”他回答道：“还剩下个架子呢。”你对过去的辣椒岁月有过怀旧之情吗？

