And now some younger farmers are opting not to plant chili at all. As Glenn showed me around his farm, he pointed out into the distance where his son was driving a tractor, raking up hay. You're going to take over after you retire? I think, but he won't do chili, I bet. Why not?
如今，一些年轻的农场主选择根本不种辣椒。当格伦带我参观他的农场时，他指着远处他的儿子正开着拖拉机在收割牧草。“你退休后他会接手吗？”“我想会的，但我敢打赌他不会种辣椒。”“为什么不呢？”

